## world-context.soar -- object-world: 4 elaborations.

## Elaborate world-agent create-world-from desired-world-context -> sets world.
## Create world structure
sp {object-world*elaborate*create-world-from*desired-world-context
   :i-support
   :default
   (state <s> ^operator.desireds.world-context <world-context>)
-->
   (<s> ^world <world-context>)
}

## Elaborate world-agent world-context world -> sets world.
sp {object-world*elaborate*world-context*world
   :default
   (state <s> ^desireds.world-context <world-context>)
-->
   (<s> ^world <world-context>)
}

## Elaborate world-agent create-world-from desired-world-context anchored-false -> sets anchored-world.
sp {object-world*elaborate*create-world-from*desired-world-context*anchored-false
   :i-support
   :default
   (state <s> ^operator.desireds.world-context <world-context>)
-->
   (<world-context> ^anchored-world false)
}

## Elaborate world-agent world-context anchored-false -> sets anchored-world.
sp {object-world*elaborate*world-context*anchored-false
   :default
   (state <s> ^desireds.world-context <world-context>)
-->
   (<world-context> ^anchored-world false)
}
